abstract: "NEUROSCAN is an AI project for brain tumor detection and classification across four conditions (Glioma, Meningioma, Pituitary Adenoma, and Healthy Brain) using a custom from-scratch 4-stage CNN architecture with Grad-CAM visual heatmaps, developed under the faculty supervision of Dr. Syed Wajid Alam."
